  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - A.\tThe proposal because its size, design and appearance would dominate the existing dwelling and would be at odds with the style and character of the dwelling, as well as being out of character with the prevailing pattern of the development in the area. The proposed single storey side extensions would be an intrusive addition which would have a negative effect on the visual amenity of the locality and adjoining residences. The proposal is considered to adversely affect the amenity of adjoining neighbours and be contrary to policies ENV.1.1 and H.3.4 of the Unitary Development Plan 1996; ENV B.1.1, H.4.1 of the Unitary Development Plan Revised Deposit (2001); and the provisions of the Revised House Extension Guidelines."
